            "kind": "text",
            "text": "• An embedded system is a small computer built into a device: a washing machine, a drone, a toy\n• It senses (buttons, light, motion), thinks (a program), and acts (lights, motors, sound)\n• The ws28p has the sensing and the thinking; the acting is what you add\n• It runs the same loop forever: read, decide, output",
            "fill": "none",
